"explanation": "Based on Document 1, the bioprinting process was involved in a significant event filing related to US patent 11517453, titled \"Bioprinting of Organ-Specific Tissue Constructs,\" granted on January 11, 2022. Based on Document 2, the bioprinting process was involved in another significant event: the passing and subsequent royal assent of the \"Bioprinting Act of 2015\" in the United Kingdom on February 12, 2015. Both documents explicitly describe these events as significant milestones involving the bioprinting process."
